/StoryReadItem/items/pbui_map_story_detail_item4.prefab","Pic":"","Content":"记录者：塔兰肯斯坦\n记录日期：自梅林大人离开后的第6324天\n运行状态：正常（存在轻度故障风险，已拒绝自检修复）\n今日维护记录：今日，我已按照指令，完成第6324次日常维护，塔内系统运转正常。\n备注：为了更高效地利用我的待机能力，我启动了全塔书籍整理计划（已重复第378轮），据统计，塔内共藏有书籍32600本（我已将它们悉数阅读完毕），其中，9507本书的扉页处有梅林大人的签名，3100本书已经出现细碎的裂纹，数据统计与上轮无异。\n日志记录完毕。","Gender":"true"}],"binding":{"method":"Blackboard.TextGalleryID","object":"510900130","textdes":"464"}},"logical_collection":"season_6","logical_chapter":"season_6","logical_story_kind":"exploration_activity","exploration_line_id":"16010413","quest_title_i18n":{"en":"The Tower's Maintenance Log","jp":"塔の管理記録","kr":"탑 관리 기록","cn":"塔内维护记录"},"quest_summary_i18n":{"en":"Prerequisite: Complete “Take a Break” in “Starlit Verdict”.\nApproach the maintenance log, then interact with it to read Cranky's notes.\nLocation: Seeker's Rest.","jp":"前提条件：「暗雲晴れて群星現る」の「ひと息つく」を完了する。\n管理記録に近づき、調べて記されている内容を読む。\n場所：探求の小屋。","kr":"선행 조건: 「먹구름 너머의 뭇별」의 「잠시 쉬기」 완료.\n관리 기록에 다가간 뒤 상호작용하여 기록 내용 읽기.\n장소: 비밀의 쉼터.","cn":"前置条件：完成《阴霾散尽现群星》中的“放松休憩”。\n靠近塔内维护记录，再与它互动阅读内容。\n地点：窥秘憩所。"},"optional_activity":true,"sequence_source":"exploration_task_graph","easter_egg_evidence":{"line_id":"16010413","section":"season_6","line":{"kind":"ExplLine","shard":"1601","record_order":"797","table_key":"16010413","record_key":"16010413","choice_index":"","LineID":"16010413","LineName":"EP6zone6彩蛋-魔法塔维护记录","ZoneGroupID":"10023","LineType":"3","LastTaskID":"1","ShowCondition":"true","RecvConditionText":"","LineDes":"","ShowAction":"true","Rewards":"[1001 | 100000002 | 50 | 1 | 205007 | 2]","ResetObjects":"[]","ResetDynGroups":"[]","ResetItems":"[]","ExtraParam":"","BlockShow":"false","EffectCondition":"true","DGender":"false","Gender":"false"},"tasks":[{"kind":"ExplTask","shard":"1601","record_order":"1727","table_key":"16010413","record_key":"16010413:1","choice_index":"","LineID":"16010413","TaskID":"1","NextTaskIDs":"[]","ClientRecvEvents":"[ExplTaskFinish:16010111:6]","RecvCondition":"ed.ConditionX.IsExplTaskFinis